  "ambient": {
    "file": "ambient.jsonl",
    "frames": 158,
    "rule": "Ambient server frames never enter a scenario file. `log` records are kept here as a set (one single-record log frame per distinct record, boot then seq order, `boot` names the server), followed by each session's last real `session` row of its boot, taken after the metrics sweep converged. Session rows in scenario files have `metrics` removed (the sweep merges it at timing-dependent moments); these final rows are the SessionMetrics samples. Unsolicited providers-snapshot / providers / scheduled-actions pushes and session rows that only refresh `metrics` or repeat the last row are dropped; each of those types is still recorded as a direct reply in a scenario."
  },
